    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Auto Farming Macro for "Grass Cutting Incremental" 
this is for players with more so maxed out settings since we have a bigger box :) 
(i have another version of this for people with mid sized boxes)

Steps:
1.click map button on bottom right
2. click field to center yourself
3. make sure youre facing straight at the grass upgrades
4. start macro

*important*
resolution required : 1920x1080</Description>
